<title>USA: Neoware Systems agrees to merger of unit.</title>
<headline>Neoware Systems agrees to merger of unit.</headline>
<dateline>KING OF PRUSSIA, Pa. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computer supplier Neoware Systems Inc said on Wednesday that it had agreed to merge its Information Technology Consultants Inc subsidiary with two privately held companies, Reohr Group Inc and GCG Consultants Inc.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, ITC and Global will merge into Reohr, and Neoware, as the sole stockholder of ITC, will receive stock of the surviving entity, Neoware said in a statement.</p>
</text>
